Separate:

CONTENT GAP
from
MERCHANT GAP.

Weak informational content with excellent ecommerce is not necessarily an opportunity.

Many sellers with terrible fitment support can be an excellent opportunity.

HARD KILL if one competent local specialist already owns the full decision path and we would merely be incrementally better.

Also adversarially search:

* OEM DTC;
* Amazon/marketplace coverage;
* manufacturer dealer network;
* hidden trade stores;
* large cross-border specialists;
* price-comparison engines;
* service-company parts sales;
