## PHASE 8 — ECONOMICS

Use verified values only.

Compute:

net_revenue
= retail_price excluding recoverable VAT/tax where appropriate

pre_ad_contribution
= net_revenue

* supplier_cost
* inbound/freight allocation
* outbound shipping subsidy
* payment fees
* expected returns/RMA reserve
* variable support cost.

Then, only when real acquisition inputs exist:

break_even_CAC = pre_ad_contribution

break_even_CPC = realistic_CVR × pre_ad_contribution.

Never call a retail-minus-public-retail-price difference “margin.”

Dealer pricing unknown = MARGIN UNKNOWN.

Do not promote to launchable while commercial access is unresolved.

