## HARD GATES BEFORE SCORING

Candidate cannot score as launchable unless all are resolved:

G1 INSTALLED BASE EXISTS
G2 REAL LIFECYCLE PURCHASE TRIGGER
G3 NONTRIVIAL COMPATIBILITY/IDENTITY PROBLEM
G4 REAL LOCAL SUPPLY
G5 GENUINE OWNERSHIP/MERCHANT GAP
G6 LEGITIMATE RESELLER/TRANSACTION PATH
G7 VIABLE OR AT LEAST TESTABLE ECONOMICS
G8 MANAGEABLE RETURNS/RMA/REGULATORY BURDEN.

If any required gate is UNKNOWN, preserve UNKNOWN.

Do not compensate for a failed gate using a high weighted score.

