Score /130:

Installed-base strength: 12
Lifecycle trigger strength: 10
Compatibility complexity/value: 15
Wrong-part/decision cost: 10
Legacy/supersession depth: 10
Merchant ownership gap: 15
Local supply quality/resilience: 10
Supplier-data normalization leverage: 8
Native-language/geographic asymmetry: 8
Commercial demand evidence: 10
Unit economics: 10
Agent/distribution leverage: 7
Operational simplicity: 5

