## KILL CONDITIONS

Kill or freeze a niche when:

* an excellent end-to-end specialist already owns it;
* a marketplace resolves compatibility and fulfillment reliably;
* OEM DTC already provides excellent fitment + stock + checkout;
* compatibility is effectively universal/simple;
* apparent scarcity is caused by negligible demand;
* reseller authorization fails;
* supplier economics fail;
* stock is structurally fragile;
* RMA/service burden destroys contribution;
* mandatory installation/licensing makes lightweight ecommerce unrealistic;
* exact-model traffic is predominantly informational rather than commercial;
* the graph would require thousands of poorly evidenced SKUs before being useful;
* a stronger candidate has materially higher expected value of information.

KILL is a successful research outcome.

